invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_avx2.c
catches: rsa_avx2_model_test
reason: the last triangle runs on its copy of the register and leaves the
  window's register 0 as it was. Its lanes from the digit count n up hold
  the result's low digits, so the result loses them; at RSA-2048, whose
  n of 74 leaves two such lanes, the products come out wrong.
  bin/rsa_avx2_model_test compares every product with rsa_mont64.c's.

--- old
        if (next + 1 == groups) {
            memcpy(window, lanes, sizeof lanes);
        }
--- new
